{"product_id":"tips-for-vintage-style","title":"Tips for Vintage Style","description":"\u003cp\u003eComfort, simplicity, the faded beauty of time-worn objects and materials--Cath Kidston's vintage style captures a way of life that many aspire to but few achieve. In \"Tips for Vintage Style,\" she shows how the smallest steps can make the biggest difference in every room in the house. Scraps of chintz, striped linens, ribbon, and haberdashery flowers are used to create tea towels and seat covers, cover ironing boards, and stitch lavender sachets--all of which would make lovely homemade gifts as well. You'll also discover ideas for making use of leftover wallpaper, transforming your bathroom into a spa, and finding the best old furniture and kitchenware--in short you'll learn how to create a home that looks timeless, comfortable, and welcoming. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:112 x 156  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Cath Kidston \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780091900380 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44790102622361,"sku":"7RF9780091900380","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/08899aaada09c14debe80d5eb1801662.jpg?v=1724949078","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/tips-for-vintage-style","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}